  <metadata>
    <name>Hennepin Hundred - 100 Miler</name>
    <desc>Hennepin Canal State Trail, Sterling IL to Colona IL. Trimmed at the Colona
      Fire Department finish (41.477633, -90.359378); the source track carried on
      1.66 mi further to the west end of the trail. Elevation is a coarse DEM,
      quantised to roughly 10 m contours, so treat the climb figure as flat rather
      than exact. Source: hellodrifter.com, drawn 2023-09-27. Timestamps dropped:
      they were all identical, so this is a drawn route, not a recorded run.</desc>
    <bounds minlat="41.32196" minlon="-90.35926" maxlat="41.79725" maxlon="-89.51767"/>
  </metadata>
